{"id":"8d331ca88ac9759e","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom.md","title":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","display":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom","aliases":["89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom"],"display":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-t-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e7a8687a65c356f\" href=\"?note=9e7a8687a65c356f\" title=\"89-df-t-axiom\">89-df-t-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the T-axiom schema.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>T axiom : 自反公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow p\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e7a8687a65c356f\" href=\"?note=9e7a8687a65c356f\" title=\"89-df-t-axiom\">89-df-t-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li>GL不包含T公理</li>\n<li>可证性不蕴含真</li>\n<li>与知识逻辑的区别</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-t-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"9e7a8687a65c356f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-t-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-t-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"9e7a8687a65c356f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"T axiom : 自反公理 $\\Box p \\rightarrow p$ (see [[89-df-t-axiom]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true}